  "description": "EuroBowl 2026 living ruleset, final version. Seven roster tiers with Team Budget, Skill Gold, and Flowing Funds distributed in 10k steps. Added skills cost 20 Skill Gold for a primary, 30 for an elite primary, 40 for a secondary, and 50 for an elite secondary. Up to three players may stack skills. Tiers 1–4 may not hire stars; Tiers 5–7 use the published Veteran and Legend Skill Gold surcharges. Star players are still paid from Team Budget.",
  "dataNote": "Flowing Funds and individual skill prices are enforced. Manual TO review is still required for the Stock Advancement +10 Skill Gold package surcharge, the three-player Secondary Advancement cap, the rule preventing Secondary or Stock Advancements when a Star is hired, and the one-Legend/no-Legend-plus-Veteran restriction; those distinctions are not expressible in the current package model. Slann and Josef Bugman are encoded from the published sheet but are not selectable until the active BB2025 dataset supplies them.",
